# Line endings are fixed in the repository whatever core.autocrlf says on a checkout. The
# release zip holds README.md and LICENSE byte for byte, the exe embeds text-sourced inputs,
# and the scripts run under bash (Git Bash on Windows), which fails on a CR at a line end.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never converted.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.bin binary
*.utf16 binary

# Captured robocopy and Explorer output: the bytes Windows produced, CRLF included, as committed.
spikes/m0/results/** -text
